    Multi-Head Attention is defined as:

    .. math::
        \text{MultiHead}(Q, K, V) = \text{Concat}(\text{head}_1,\dots,\text{head}_h)W^O

    where :math:`\text{head}_i = \text{Attention}(QW_i^Q, KW_i^K, VW_i^V)`.

